OL,3,GNEWSARenovations 'haven't led to more
OL,4,Asales', say traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthampton Market Square renovations
OL,7,Fhave not led to a long-term increase in
OL,8,Fsales, some traders have said.
OL,10,FIt reopened in October 2024 following
OL,11,F#13.5m of works, including specially
OL,12,Fmade kiosks, new paving, lighting,
OL,13,Fseating and a water feature.
OL,15,FWest Northamptonshire Council said the
OL,16,FMarket Square remains a priority and it
OL,17,Fplayed an important role in supporting
OL,18,Flocal businesses, attracting visitors
OL,19,Fand creating opportunities for people
OL,20,Fto come together.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
