OL,3,GNEWSARenovations 'haven't led to more
OL,4,Asales', say traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe improvements were funded through
OL,7,Fthe government's Future High Streets
OL,8,FFund, the Community Infrastructure Levy
OL,9,F(CIL) and an additional #1m from the
OL,10,Fcouncil's general fund after the
OL,11,Fproject went over budget.
